{"kind":"assert","text":"Planner decisions from the page delivery note (request/i5-page, section 5), for the owners and for builder's integration of the three cloud branches. (1) A client never carries a definition's bytes. The directory's open-issue and open-pr read the activated definition's bytes from the rules scope's retained value, by the digest the act names, as an observation of the rules scope at the head the directory reads; the stated value place of commit c6fe198 is satisfied by that read, not by a value sent beside the intent. Until that rule exists, the client may send the retained bytes it reads from the rules scope as the value, labelled as the stand-in. Owner: the authority note (directory rows) with the contract's observes form; builder may build the read within the lane wiring's filing. (2) The page is served by the service from its own origin (a static route of the Worker), so no cross-origin headers are added; a decision on cross-origin serving waits until someone needs it. (3) Reads before a session: decided at 61cc5e50; the page's directory read follows the same rule (the claim key reads the directory's summary and genesis without a session within the window). (4) Live updates and the infrastructure effect's states are not in gate 3; plan 016's effect states show the Git publication's own outside operations, which is what main has."}